{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-amo-5-1","title":"Amos 5:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 A lamentation for Israel. 4 An exhortation to repentance. 21 God rejects their hypocritical service.</p>\n<p>Hear. 3:1; 4:1 I take. 16; Jer 7:29; 9:10,17,20; Eze 19:1,14; 26:17; 27:2,27-32; 28:12 Eze 32:2,16; Mic 2:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-2","title":"Amos 5:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>virgin. Isa 37:22; Jer 14:17; 18:13; 31:4; La 2:13 is fallen. 2Ki 15:29; 17:16; Isa 3:8; Ho 14:1 she shall. Isa 14:21; 24:20; 43:17; Jer 51:64 she is. Jer 4:20 none. 7:2-5; 9:11; Isa 51:17,18; Jer 2:27; 30:12-14; La 1:16-19 Eze 16:36,37; Ho 6:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-3","title":"Amos 5:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>The city. De 4:27; 28:62; Isa 1:9; 10:22; Eze 12:16; Ro 9:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-4","title":"Amos 5:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Seek. 6; De 30:1-8; 1Ch 28:9; 2Ch 15:2; 20:3; 34:3; Ps 14:2; 27:8 Isa 55:6,7; Jer 29:12,13; La 3:25,26; Zep 2:3; Mt 7:8 and. Ps 22:26; 69:32; 105:3,4; Isa 55:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-5","title":"Amos 5:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>seek. 4:4; Ho 4:15; 9:15; 10:14,15; 12:11 Beer-sheba. 8:14; Ge 21:33 Gilgal.There is a paronomasia here, both on the letters and words: {hag-gilgal galoh yigleh oovaith el yiheyeh le�wen,} \"Gilgal shall surely go into captivity, and Beth-el (the house of God) shall come to nought,\" or Aven, i.e., Beth-aven, the house of iniquity.</p>\n<p>and Beth-el. 7:17; Le 26:30-32; De 28:41; Ho 4:15; 10:8,15 come. Job 8:22; Ps 33:10; Isa 8:10; 29:20; 1Co 1:28; 2:6; Re 18:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-6","title":"Amos 5:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Seek. 4; Eze 33:11 lest. Ex 22:6 the house. 6:6; Ge 48:8-20; Jos 18:5; Jud 1:22,23; 2Sa 19:20; 1Ki 11:28 Eze 37:19; Zec 10:6 there. Isa 1:31; Jer 4:4; 7:20; Eze 20:47,48; Mr 9:43-48</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-7","title":"Amos 5:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>turn. 11,12; 6:12; De 29:18; Isa 1:23; 5:7; 10:1; 59:13,14; Ho 10:4 Hab 1:12-14 leave. Ps 36:3; 125:5; Eze 3:20; 18:24; 33:12,13,18; Zep 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-8","title":"Amos 5:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>maketh. Job 9:9; 38:31,32 and turneth. Job 12:22; 38:12,13; Ps 107:10-14; Mt 4:16; Lu 1:79 maketh. 4:13; 8:9; Ex 10:21-23; 14:24-28; Ps 104:20; 105:28; Isa 59:10 that calleth. 9:6; Ge 7:11-20; 1Ki 18:44,45; Job 37:13; 38:34 The Lord. 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-9","title":"Amos 5:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>strengtheneth. 2Ki 13:17,25; Jer 37:10; Heb 11:34 spoiled. Heb. spoil.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-10","title":"Amos 5:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>hate. 7:10-17; 1Ki 18:17; 21:20; 22:8; 2Ch 24:20-22; 25:16; 36:16; Pr 9:7,8 Isa 29:21; Jer 20:7-10; Joh 7:7; 15:19,22-24; Re 11:10 abhor. Jer 17:16,17; Joh 3:20; 8:45-47</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-11","title":"Amos 5:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>treading. 4:1; Isa 5:7,8; 59:13,14; Mic 2:2; 3:1-3; Jas 2:6; Re 11:8-10 ye have built. De 28:30,38,39; Isa 65:21,22; Mic 6:15; Zep 1:13; Hag 1:6 pleasant vineyards. Heb. vineyards of desire.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-12","title":"Amos 5:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>I know. De 31:21; Isa 66:18; Jer 29:23; Heb 4:12,13 manifold. 2Ki 17:7-17; Isa 47:9 they afflict. 2:6,7,16; Ac 3:13,14; 7:52; Jas 5:4,6 take. 1Sa 8:3; Ps 26:9,10; Isa 1:23; 33:15; Mic 3:11; 7:3 bribe. or, ransom. and they. 2:7; Isa 10:2; 29:21; La 3:34; Mal 3:5 in the. 10; De 16:18; Ru 4:1; Job 29:7-25; 31:21; Pr 22:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-13","title":"Amos 5:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>the prudent. 6:10; Ec 3:7; Isa 36:21; Ho 4:4; Mic 7:5-7; Mt 27:12-14 an evil. Ec 9:12; Isa 37:3; Mic 2:3; Hab 3:16; Zep 2:2,3; Eph 5:15,16; 6:13 2Ti 3:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-14","title":"Amos 5:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Seek. Ps 34:12-16; Pr 11:27; Isa 1:16,17; 55:2; Mic 6:8; Mt 6:33; Ro 2:7-9 and so. 3:3; Ge 39:2,3,23; Ex 3:12; Jos 1:9; 1Ch 28:20; 2Ch 15:2; Ps 46:11 Isa 8:10; Mt 1:23; 28:20; Php 4:8,9; 2Ti 4:22 as. Nu 16:3; Isa 48:1,2; Jer 7:3,4; Mic 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-15","title":"Amos 5:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Hate. Ps 34:14; 36:4; 37:27; 97:10; 119:104; 139:21,22; Ro 7:15,16,22; 8:7 Ro 12:9; 1Th 5:21,22; 3Jo 1:11 establish. 10,24; 6:12; 2Ch 19:6-11; Ps 82:2-4; Jer 7:5-7 it may. Ex 32:30; 2Sa 16:12; 1Ki 20:31; 2Ki 19:4; Joe 2:14; Jon 3:9 the remnant. 6; 2Ki 13:7; 14:26,27; 15:29; Jer 31:7; Mic 2:12; 5:3,7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-16","title":"Amos 5:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>the Lord. 27; 3:13 Wailing. 8:10; Isa 15:2-5,8; 22:12; Jer 4:31; 9:10,18-20; Joe 1:8,11,14 Mic 1:8; 2:4; Re 18:10,15,16,19 such. Jer 9:17-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-17","title":"Amos 5:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>in. Isa 16:10; 32:10-12; Jer 48:33; Ho 9:1,2 I will. Ex 12:12,23; Joe 3:17; Na 1:12,15; Zec 9:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-18","title":"Amos 5:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>desire. Isa 5:19; 28:15-22; Jer 17:15; Eze 12:22,27; Mal 3:1,2; 2Pe 3:4 the day of the Lord is. Isa 5:30; 9:19; 24:11,12; Jer 30:7; Joe 1:15; 2:1,2,10,31 Zep 1:14,15; Mal 4:1; 2Pe 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-19","title":"Amos 5:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>As if.They should go from one evil to another.</p>\n<p>9:1,2; 1Ki 20:29,30; Job 20:24,25; Isa 24:17,18; Jer 15:2,3 Jer 48:43,44; Ac 28:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-20","title":"Amos 5:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>darkness. Job 3:4-6; 10:21,22; Isa 13:10; Eze 34:12; Na 1:8; Mt 22:13 Jude 1:13; Re 16:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-21","title":"Amos 5:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>hate. Pr 15:8; 21:27; 28:9; Isa 1:11-16; 66:3; Jer 6:20; 7:21-23; Ho 8:13 Mt 23:14 I will. Ge 8:21; Le 26:31; Eph 5:2; Php 4:18 smell in your solemn assemblies. or, smell your holy days.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-22","title":"Amos 5:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>offer. Ps 50:8-13; Isa 66:3; Mic 6:6,7 peace offerings. or, thank offerings. 4:4,5; Le 7:12-15; Ps 50:14,23; 107:21,22; 116:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-23","title":"Amos 5:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>the noise. 6:5; 8:3,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-24","title":"Amos 5:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>let. 7,14,15; Job 29:12-17; Pr 21:3; Ho 6:6; Mic 6:8; Mr 12:32-34 run. Heb. roll.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-25","title":"Amos 5:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Le 17:7; De 32:17-19; Jos 24:14; Ne 9:18,21; Isa 43:23,24 Eze 20:8,16,24; Ho 9:9,10; Zec 7:5; Ac 7:42,43</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-26","title":"Amos 5:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>the tabernacle of your Moloch. or, Siccuth your king. Le 18:21; 20:2-5; 1Ki 11:33; 2Ki 23:12,13 Milcom.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-amo-5-27","title":"Amos 5:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"AMO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>beyond. 2Ki 15:29; 17:6; Ac 7:43 whose. 4:13</p>"}]}